mer for 5 minutes. Remove from the heat. Garnish with coriander leaves before serving.","sourceText":"Add fresh cream and clarified butter, and let it simmer for 5 minutes. Remove from the heat. Garnish with coriander leaves before serving.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":9,"text":"Serve hot with naan, paratha or rice.","sourceText":"Serve hot with naan, paratha or rice.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:185952","recordId":"wikibooks-185952-r4517540","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4517540","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Dal%20Makhani%20(Black%20Gram%20with%20Cream)&oldid=4517540","sourceSha256":"2cc3cdda803aa3ebc2c10ec3493b0b038c11b729ce4b73704cde5aa84d626884","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"reviewStatus":"source-extracted-unreviewed","changeNotice":"Source-language section extraction; markup removed. Not culinarily revi